      "html": "<section class=\"ds-inspector\"><div class=\"ds-inspector-heading\"><h2>Inside the object</h2><select aria-label=\"Choose an object\"><option>3 0 R \u00b7 Page</option><option>7 0 R \u00b7 Stream</option><option>Document trailer</option></select></div><pre tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"PDF dictionary syntax\">&lt;&lt;\n  /Type /Page\n  /MediaBox [ 0 0 595 420 ]\n  /Resources &lt;&lt; /Font &lt;&lt; /F1 6 0 R &gt;&gt; &gt;&gt;\n  /Contents 7 0 R\n&gt;&gt;</pre></section>",
